{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robots Arena Fight: SYSTEM ONLINE. Engage in metallic mayhem. Deploy BULL. Deploy WASP. Lasers, rockets, chaos. Target locked. Smash, blast, dominate. No rules\u2014only steel, fire, and victory. Mission accepted. Combat initiated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/cbf3b622c19d0cb279c7fcda4b7eb2bb.poster.avif?t=1760723983\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/cbf3b622c19d0cb279c7fcda4b7eb2bb.webm?t=1760723983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/cbf3b622c19d0cb279c7fcda4b7eb2bb.mp4?t=1760723983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Robots Arena Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots Arena Fight drops you into a futuristic battlefield where mechs rule and only the strongest survive. Choose between BULL and WASP, equip deadly weapons like lasers and missiles, and take on 4 intense missions filled with action and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/39e2faaff7d251cc1944779dbb56ff84.poster.avif?t=1760723983\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/39e2faaff7d251cc1944779dbb56ff84.webm?t=1760723983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943420/extras/39e2faaff7d251cc1944779dbb56ff84.mp4?t=1760723983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 cla